==Battleground==
*3 [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 17.67 seconds<sup>530f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 17.33 seconds<sup>520f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 17 seconds<sup>510f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Freeze|Freezing]] [[Cat Combo]]s are good here, in combination with [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]]. All you really need to do in the beginning is stall and send out Bombercats as well as [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Robocats]]: the latter of which is useful here due to him being able to [[knockback]] the Dark Otters safely past the base without even worrying about the [[Assassin Bear]]s in the first place. Alternatively, you can kill the Dark Otters early on using [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]]  and fire the [[Cat Cannon]] to kill the Assassin Bears afterwards, but overall this stage should be of little issue either way. In higher difficulties, the Assassin Bears start to survive the Cat Cannon, but using the Robocat KB strategy becomes easier due to the higher HP of the Dark Otters.

